Every list/page has 3 states: skeleton loading, compact empty state, error with Retry. Images: lazy-loaded, fixed aspect-ratio box, onError fallback (never a black box, never alt text). Accessibility: AA contrast, visible focus ring, aria labels, keyboard navigation, minimum tap target 44px.

